2", "chunk_len_words": 512, "doc_id": "Hansard 12th June, 2025", "title": "Hansard 12th June, 2025", "sha256_pdf": "84e5026304f7c46d2154b7fbf6debd2d9a6a5b2deb5c1c9dfc48d67273faf5d6", "pdf_path": "data/corpus/clean/pdfs/2025-06-12 - Hansard 12th June 2025.pdf"}}, {"rank": 5, "chunk_id": "888e3eff0f49cdf77dfcb72ccd7c599961ba602e709f7dd74027846b9df447fe:57", "distance": 0.8602205514907837, "metadata": {"date_iso": "2024-11-19", "chunk_index": 57, "title": "Hansard 19th December, 2024", "source_url": "https://www.parliament.gh/epanel/docs/pb/19th December 2024.pdf", "chunk_len_words": 512, "pdf_path": "data/corpus/clean/pdfs/2024-11-19 - Hansard 19th December 2024.pdf", "doc_id": "Hansard 19th December, 2024", "sha256_pdf": "888e3eff0f49cdf77dfcb72ccd7c599961ba602e709f7dd74027846b9df447fe"}}]}, "prev_hash": "6176b73bf25cac6741cdee545a80fdadfe1daaac9e22a8b68d1d34f4ba66ad3c", "event_hash": "47343c7785fd1bf09a9ee5a3568006df5c96cbae2c4a6bd589db2995e93e1b77"}
{"ts_utc": "2026-05-12T16:00:54.714966Z", "run_id": "20260512_160026_rag_L3_B3_06dee3", "seq": 5, "event": "generation.completed", "payload": {"answer": "Parliament discussed healthcare delivery and public health services in relation to medical stores lacking essential medicines and non-drugs [888e3eff0f49cdf77dfcb72ccd7c599961ba602e709f7dd74027846b9df447fe:57]. This issue affects the quality of healthcare in health facilities, as patients are asked to go to private stores to buy these commodities [888e3eff0f49cdf77dfcb72ccd7c599961ba602e709f7dd74027846b9df447fe:57].\n\nAdditionally, there was a discussion about the nurses' strike and the need for the Health Ministry to address their concerns [84e5026304f7c46d2154b7fbf6debd2d9a6a5b2deb5c1c9dfc48d67273faf5d6:37]. The Minister for Health assured that a meeting would be held with the nurses to address their concerns [84e5026304f7c46d2154b7fbf6debd2d9a6a5b2deb5c1c9dfc48d67273faf5d6:37].\n\nThere was also a mention of the 24-Hour Economy policy, which includes a programme for rapid industrialization and tax exemptions [e5b9ac063f1a59fee355155f6117bdfef639bb6c2b823d1544e1f59133187e62:30].", "answer_sha256": "767f8687f62cadd608596a7a116cb22d3ee8dc15bb260456d3f224528948a063"}, "prev_hash": "47343c7785fd1bf09a9ee5a3568006df5c96cbae2c4a6bd589db2995e93e1b77", "event_hash": "f5483c4a274ba5b60eae1b9a76d3f8b75a7667eb8c6a04159545e7b2f717fb84"}
